        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9638/82 Solid Brass Oval Ring Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis oval-shaped solid brass cabinet knob has a slight rustic quality that gives off a homey feel. It is details like this cabinet knob that help transform a house into a home, and this knob is not without warmth. Everything from the beaded edges to the floral pattern in the center lend a richness that will help any space feel more cozy and welcoming.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: Similar design <a href=\"/site/department.cfm?id=41701\"><b>Omnia Ornate Cabinet Pulls</b></a>. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's line of sophisticated cabinet hardware have been painstakingly crafted by artisans who understand that a beautiful design must be as comfortable to the hand as it is pleasing to the eyes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Decorative Series Omnia 9638/82 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid brass construction regardless of finish.</li>\r\n<li>Pull Length (center to center): 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Length: 3-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Backplate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
